  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Two storey side extension; single storey side and rear extensions; external alterations; timber canopy structure to rear (Demolition of detached garage)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The proposed two storey side extension together with the proposed two storey rear extension, by reason of their excessive combined width, bulk, massing and poor design would result in an incongruous, discordant, contrived, unduly bulky and dominant addition to the host dwelling and street scene, to the detriment of the character and appearance of the property and area. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 D.1, D.11, D.12 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1 (B) of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), policy DM 1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010) and the draft Harrow Local Plan GR1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
